---

The data files under data/raw/ are cached copies of publicly available series
from Yahoo Finance, FRED and ALFRED, redistributed here so the study reproduces
offline and so the exact macro vintages it used can be inspected. They remain
subject to their originators' terms.

Ashcroft University Endowment and Coldbrook Capital are fictional. The
Investment Policy Statement, the mandate and the design system were written for
this exercise.
